Sorry I gave for granted a third principle. Let me recap:

- Is it readable and easy to the eye ?
- does it allow a quicker identification of the sentence components?
- If I strip all non-lojbanic elements (quotes, parenthesis, etc) is the
result correct according to lojban rules?

So there must be three "yes" :)

